{"title": "Monster Races Books Table", "pageid": 45509, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Monster_Races_Books_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Book drop tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Monster Races Books Table</b>, also known as <code>GEN_Book_Monster_Races</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GEN_Book_Monster_Races+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GEN_Book_Monster_Races+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a non-leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> containing books on Monster races.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_table\">Drop table</span></h2>\n<p><i>Rolls 1-2 times on the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Monster Races Books Table</a>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n  <tbody><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><th>Quantity</th><td>1</td><td>2</td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"text-align:center\"><th>Chance</th>  <td>9/10</td><td>1/10</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{#lst:Monster Races Books Table|table}}</code>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Brush_with_Evil:_On_Hags\" title=\"A Brush with Evil: On Hags\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Book_Tome_O_Item_Icon.png/40px